{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_11", "source_id": "685bb2120000000022032fad", "title": "一年针清20次，闭口怎么还没好？", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_685bb2120000000022032fad", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 913, "evidence_unit_count": 18, "original_evidence_unit_count": 18, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["当然好不了 这是之前最困扰我的事情，我以前一年不止针清20次，我一周清一次，一个月就要清4次，但每次清完过3、4天又长出来了", "我们油脂出不去，堵在毛孔里成软软的固态，久而久之就变成一粒粒的油脂粒在毛孔里，就是闭口", "1、油皮是一定要把水杨酸用在日常护肤当中的，因为我们角质层很容易过厚，角质层厚皮肤看起来就颗粒感很重，化妆也不服帖，摸起来都很粗糙", "很多10几年的痘肌姐妹跟我说，自从做了家庭版海菲秀，就从油痘肌变成了健康的油皮了～", "#闭口没有了[话题]# #油痘肌护肤[话题]# #如何去闭口[话题]# #素颜好皮帮帮忙[话题]#", "防晒、面霜、以及护发素这三个品类，我感觉是油皮最容易踩雷的三个品类，这三个品类你们如果用到了新的，在前三天一定要好好观察皮肤状态，一般闷痘前三天就能感受出来了，这个时候及时停止用几天酸，皮肤又能恢复到……", "其实大部分闭口星人都是这个状态，因为清的时候只能清掉成型的闭口，但其实还有些半成型的闭口在毛孔里没清掉，所以清完过几天又会长"], "retained_quotes": ["防晒、面霜、以及护发素这三个品类，我感觉是油皮最容易踩雷的三个品类，这三个品类你们如果用到了新的，在前三天一定要好好观察皮肤状态，一般闷痘前三天就能感受出来了，这个时候及时停止用几天酸，皮肤又能恢复到……", "其实大部分闭口星人都是这个状态，因为清的时候只能清掉成型的闭口，但其实还有些半成型的闭口在毛孔里没清掉，所以清完过几天又会长"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_685bb2120000000022032fad/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_685bb2120000000022032fad/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_685bb2120000000022032fad/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_685bb2120000000022032fad/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "63525ad7e110e77cd9f44f78001bfccb0ff55eda0aa55dd899ed0712e59722f7", "card_hash": "f234604d4e2c6ba6145e6e35884129a20090f45790519fc2266d35dc4a945f0b", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_11", "source_id": "6857fab6000000002400fecb", "title": "沉浸式！一周一次家庭版🌊飞秀～", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6857fab6000000002400fecb", "topic_family": "毛孔与清洁", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 181, "evidence_unit_count": 3, "original_evidence_unit_count": 0, "visual_review_unit_count": 3, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "video_frame_review_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["无有效口播的家庭版毛孔清洁视频以Step字幕推进", "无有效口播的家庭版毛孔清洁视频以Step字幕推进", "抽查帧可见蒸脸预热；Step1按实际出油部位敷黑头导出液；中段用工具轻刮表面油脂并提示角质堆积处可重点但不等于普适；Step4敷蓝膜照顾鼻翼、下颌边角；Step5先用面膜湿润后清理深层油脂；Step6上多肽精华做毛孔疏通后的护理", "可学习的是编号步骤、画面示范和局部条件提示；家庭器械与护理流程不能写成专业项目等效方案", "可学习的是编号步骤、画面示范和局部条件提示；家庭器械与护理流程不能写成专业项目等效方案"], "retained_quotes": [], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6857fab6000000002400fecb/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6857fab6000000002400fecb/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6857fab6000000002400fecb/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6857fab6000000002400fecb/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "d321069d6dde2ce5b8286d999f21d98da555f5f313b4a565f6938792f141f1ab", "card_hash": "67cdbafbede9589d370103df26be9cf2e3b2dcd5ad6a12be6a0be89bf76aa764", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
